3. Conditions

When redistributing source, retain this license, copyright notices, and
attribution notices. Mark modified versions as modified and do not represent
them as the unmodified original.

Any application distributed with covered Coding-board material must show a
clear attribution in an in-app About, Credits, or Open-source licenses screen:

  This application uses Coding-board keyboard source by silent (Mohammad Nick),
  adapted from Unexpected Keyboard by Julow.

The in-app attribution must identify both Coding-board and Unexpected
Keyboard as sources. Include the source project address
<https://github.com/Julow/Unexpected-Keyboard> when the screen supports links.
Keep this notice visible and accessible to users of the application.

